## Problem classes

### `Unknown SSID always`

| Symptom | Cause | Fix |
| ------- | ----- | --- |
| Every Wi-Fi is "unknown" | Missing `NEARBY_WIFI_DEVICES` / `ACCESS_FINE_LOCATION` | Request on AUTO or Links screen; banner; still default PROXY |

<!-- last-verified: 2026-08 -->

### `Wrong SIM profile`

| Symptom | Cause | Fix |
| ------- | ----- | --- |
| SIM 1 profile while data is SIM 2 | Used `default` slot not data sub | `DataSubscriptionIds.activeOrNull()` — API 30+ `getActiveDataSubscriptionId`, else `getDefaultDataSubscriptionId` |

<!-- last-verified: 2026-08 -->

### `Data sub NewApi lint`

| Symptom | Cause | Fix |
| ------- | ----- | --- |
| Lint `getActiveDataSubscriptionId` requires API 30 on minSdk 26 | Static method added in API 30 | Centralize in `DataSubscriptionIds`; pre-R use `getDefaultDataSubscriptionId()` |

<!-- last-verified: 2026-08 -->

### `Callback never unregisters`

| Symptom | Cause | Fix |
| ------- | ----- | --- |
| Battery drain when mode OFF | `NetworkCallback` left registered | `LinkObserver` watches `globalMode`; unregister + `debouncer.cancel()` on OFF |

<!-- last-verified: 2026-08 -->

### `Vpn overlay classified as Other`

| Symptom | Cause | Fix |
| ------- | ----- | --- |
| AUTO flaps when our VPN is up | `activeNetwork` is `TRANSPORT_VPN` | If ours (`ZerotierBVpnService.state.isRunning`), scan non-VPN nets via `PhysicalLinkSelector`; third-party VPN → Other |

<!-- last-verified: 2026-08 -->
